# Security

## Defence layers

```mermaid
graph TB
    Internet --> CF[Cloudflare Edge\nDDoS + WAF]
    CF --> RL[Rate limiting\n10 req/min per IP — KV]
    RL --> Headers[Security headers\nCSP X-Frame X-Content-Type]
    Headers --> Auth{Route type?}
    Auth -->|Public| Public[No auth — rate limited]
    Auth -->|Admin pages| Cookie[egac_admin_token cookie]
    Auth -->|Admin API| Bearer[Authorization: Bearer ADMIN_TOKEN]
    Auth -->|Cron| CronTok[Authorization: Bearer CRON_SECRET]
    Auth -->|Coach app| Access[Cloudflare Access\nZero Trust]
    Cookie -->|Invalid| Login[→ /admin/login]
    Bearer & CronTok -->|Invalid| E401[401 Unauthorized]
    Access -->|No header| E403[403 Forbidden]
```

## Security headers (all responses)

| Header | Value |
|---|---|
| `X-Content-Type-Options` | `nosniff` |
| `X-Frame-Options` | `DENY` |
| `Referrer-Policy` | `strict-origin-when-cross-origin` |
| `Content-Security-Policy` | `default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' cdn.tailwindcss.com; frame-ancestors 'none'; ...` |

## Rate limiting

Applied to `POST /api/enquiry`, `/api/booking`, `/api/academy/respond`:

```
KV key: ratelimit:{CF-Connecting-IP}:{YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM}
Limit:  10 requests per minute per IP
Return: 429 + Retry-After: 60
```

KV errors are caught and logged — a KV outage never blocks legitimate requests.

## SQL injection prevention

All D1 queries use `?` placeholders via `.bind()`. No string concatenation in SQL.

Dynamic `SET` clauses (e.g. `updateEnquiry`) build the clause string from a **whitelist of allowed field names** — user data only ever reaches `.bind()` positions.

```typescript
// ✅ User value reaches bind(), never the query string
db.prepare('SELECT * FROM enquiries WHERE id = ? AND environment = ?')
  .bind(id, environment)
```

## Error handling

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    E[Thrown error] --> Known{Known\nerror class?}
    Known -->|ValidationError 400| R400[400 + message]
    Known -->|AuthError 401| R401[401]
    Known -->|NotFoundError 404| R404[404]
    Known -->|ConflictError 409| R409[409]
    Known -->|RateLimitError 429| R429[429 + Retry-After]
    Known -->|Unknown| Log[Log error + context]
    Log --> R500[500\noriginal message hidden]
```

Stack traces and internal details are **never** exposed in API responses.

## Environment isolation

```mermaid
graph LR
    Dev[APP_ENV=development] -->|AND environment='development'| D1[(D1)]
    Prod[APP_ENV=production] -->|AND environment='production'| D1
    Dev -. cannot see .-> ProdRows[production rows]
    Prod -. cannot see .-> DevRows[development rows]
```

Same physical D1 database — isolation enforced by query filter on every request.

